        },
        {
          "text": " naa ore apa pee eirriwaa intae Olaitoriani Kadesh-Barnea, ejo, ‘Elepa enchom embung'a ina kop naishoo nanu intae’ nitogolong'akita intae enkitanapata o Laitoriani Enkai inyi, neitu intae irukuruku ninye aashu ining'ining'i oltoilo lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itaa intae iloogolong'aki Olaitoriani ebaiki ina olong natayiolo intae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Neaku airrabalakine nanu enkop te dukuya Olaitoriani te kuna olong'i artam e nkewarieitin artam, naatejo Olaitoriani keidaikie intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomon nanu Olaitoriani najo, ‘Olaitoriani Enkai, Ooi mindaikie iltung'ana linono o enjung'ore ino, laa iyie otokordua te nkitoo ino, naa iyie oitupukuo te nkop e Misiri te nkaina magilani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tadamu isinkan linono, Abraham o Isaak o Yakobo; mishilaa engolon enkong'u ele orere, aashu ntorrok enye, aashu eng'oki enye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mejo ake ina kop nintupukunye iyiook, “Enkaraki apa nemeidim Olaitoriani ayau ninche atua ina kop apa naisiligie ninche, naa ore enkaraki naibayie ninye ninche eitupukuo ninche pee elotu aar ninche tiong'ata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu iltung'ana linono ninche naa enjung'ore ino ninche, laa iyie oitupukuo ninche te ngolon ino kitok o te nkaina ino naitoriori.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
